\title{susieSlide: Sum of Single Effects with Genotype Sliders}
\description{
Fits genetic effects using the Sum of Single Effects (SuSiE) model with a bounded heterozygote slider for each candidate SNP and component. Gaussian effect coefficients are integrated analytically; sliders are estimated by empirical Bayes with a rare-genotype additive fallback. Includes the IBSS engine, compiled slider inference, slider-aware predictions and credible sets, and an explicitly named additive fitting entry point. Derived from susieR and Wang et al (2020) \doi{10.1101/501114} and Zou et al (2021) \doi{10.1101/2021.11.03.467167}.
}
